Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:18.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Mr. Perverted Kidnapper!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:22.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It is far too early for \NMiss Anya to get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:26.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Even I just got married this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:34.47,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:37.55,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:40.51,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:43.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.48,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:49.57,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:52.61,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:54.61,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:01:01.37,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:08.29,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:15.17,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:21.10,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:27.10,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:33.36,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:41.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:53.67,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:10.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There, there. You're all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:12.85,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,That's her mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.85,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Tch! Now we'll have to dispose of both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:19.48,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Hey, pup! Rip out that woman's throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.48,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Hey, come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.28,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:32.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What? But you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:33.87,main,Passerby,0,0,0,,What's going on? A fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:36.30,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Damn it. I can't have more people notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:39.17,main,Keith,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come{\i0}, you big-ass mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.17,0:02:40.14,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.85,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:52.16,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No... You mustn't leave \NMiss Anya alone again, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:03:00.23,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That should teach Mr. Kidnapper a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:05.69,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,First, I should hand this \Nman over to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:07.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mister Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Who is that puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:10.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:14.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What?! Terrorists and bomb puppies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.26,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:19.42,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.36,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,{\i0}seem{\i1} to have a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:25.89,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog here saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:30.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-The most important thing is \Nthat you're safe, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:32.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:39.11,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is sorry... that she ran \Noff without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:42.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll have to give you a stern \Ntalking-to when we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:56.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, we need to report \Nthis to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:04:01.36,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya, do you happen to remember \Nwhat the bad guys looked like,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:04.39,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(369,285)\fscx85\fad(525,522)}DISARM THE TIME BOMB
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.65,top,Yor,0,0,0,,or perhaps parts of their conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:06.88,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Um... I'll try real hard to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:10.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:13.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:16.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,One is here next to me, unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:20.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm just a housewife \Nthat happened to pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:27.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:33.38,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Are you... looking into the future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:43.40,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:49.68,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:00.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:06.10,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,Westalis condemns in the strongest terms \Nthe Ostanian government
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.66,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,regarding the incident with the \Nminister and the extremists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:12.44,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,It is believed that a conflict between \Nthe East and West is now unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:17.82,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That was from the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:22.46,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The future is in trouble! Papa is \Ngonna die and peace will be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:26.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Now, now, Miss Anya! You mustn't \Nbe mean to the poor puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing... Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:32.72,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is going to die in an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.69,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'll tell Mama and have her save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:40.02,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,But I can't tell her about my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:46.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog...  Can we change \Nthe future if we try real hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:50.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Can you still run?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:52.62,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:58.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm sorry. I just remembered something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:01.41,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa forgot to take toilet \Npaper to the potty with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:01.98,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:06.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He might be in big trouble now, so I'm \Ngonna go take him some toilet paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:10.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya... Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,She ran off again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:16.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. But that's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.53,0:06:18.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please make sure you arrest this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.24,italics,Lady on phone,0,0,0,,Wai—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:28.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya! Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:32.31,main,Agent A,0,0,0,,Handler!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:35.19,main,Agent A,0,0,0,,We've intercepted a report
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:38.39,main,Agent A,0,0,0,,of a terrorist sighted in an \Nalley near Central Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:42.63,main,Agent A,0,0,0,,The physical description \Nmatches one of the students.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:44.17,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,So they're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:47.90,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have a team stand by on the suspected route \Nthey may take from the reported area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:50.18,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We'll commandeer the white \Nvan that comes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:54.43,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It might be carrying explosives. \NProceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.43,main,Terrorist A,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:13.24,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,Alpha Team here. We've secured the targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.20,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,Four members and three dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:17.78,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,We also found a case \Npossibly containing explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.84,italics,Bravo,0,0,0,,Bravo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:22.02,italics,Bravo,0,0,0,,We've also captured three members.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:25.53,main,Bravo,0,0,0,,Our main target, Keith Kepler, \Nis nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:27.41,main,Bravo,0,0,0,,We will continue our search of the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:31.25,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,They're onto us! Is that the Secret Police?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:32.96,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,No, are they from the West?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:34.23,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:36.71,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,I've only got two hours \Nbefore the summit starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.21,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,There's one more place where \Nwe have bombs hidden, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:45.74,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,There's no other way! Even if \NI have to do this on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:48.80,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.22,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,Where's the explosion site, \Nand where's Keith?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.89,main,Terrorist B,0,0,0,,My only answer to that is, "Eat shit."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:57.23,main,Terrorist B,0,0,0,,Go stick your head in a \Nshitter, you putrid swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:07:59.79,main,Terrorist A,0,0,0,,Strike down the pigs from the West!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.24,main,Terrorists C & D,0,0,0,,Strike them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:02.81,main,Terrorists A; C; D,0,0,0,,Strike them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.78,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,You little punk...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:09.38,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Leave the howling to the dogs. \NYou're making my ears hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:15.83,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Hello there, students.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:18.30,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What exactly do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:20.84,main,Terrorist B,0,0,0,,A war!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:24.34,main,Terrorist B,0,0,0,,The extermination of the \NWest and Ostanian supremacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:29.22,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have any of you actually \Nkilled a person before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:32.24,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever been killed by anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.02,main,Terrorist A,0,0,0,,Of course we haven't, you stupid bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:36.94,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever lost a limb in an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:41.19,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard bones being smashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:44.79,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever smelled festering flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:48.29,main,Terrorist A,0,0,0,,What the hell are you \Ntalking about, you stupid hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:50.06,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen your parents or siblings
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.84,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,crushed in a crumbling building,\N right before your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:57.43,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a piece of your \Nlover's flesh stuck to a wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:02.40,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever been so hungry, \Nyou tried to bite into a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.07,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever stewed human flesh in a pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:09.16,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Have you ever had someone close \Nto you deny your enemy's humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.53,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,so they could continue the killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:13.94,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,only to become so mentally \Nbroken after the conflict is over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:16.12,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,that they weep with regret and shame,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:20.81,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,vomit, and then eventually... \Ntake their own life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:32.72,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Apparently, you've learned nothing \Nof war at your university,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.83,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,you utter children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:39.03,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Listen up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:43.18,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Once you catch the minister's scent, \Ndon't you dare lose sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:46.41,main,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:51.16,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,But... the point where we were \Nsupposed to ambush him in Plan B
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.52,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,might've also been discovered, \Nsince those guys got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:56.69,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Which would mean more guards in \Nthe area around the clock tower plaza,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.10,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,making it useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:10:00.50,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Actually, in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:03.53,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll just lure any bastards who try to get \Nin my way into a trap and eliminate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.36,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Just you wait, you pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:08.90,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll blow you all to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:18.19,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,All teams: investigate points B1 through B4.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:21.63,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Twilight, I'd like you to \Ninvestigate the area around B1,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:23.32,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,which will be the most probable target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.75,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Stop them, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:28.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I know, Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:31.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I am absolutely done...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,with war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:42.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Found it! It's where the pointy clock is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That way, Mister Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's where Papa's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We have to stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:54.52,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,Here in Central Berlint,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:58.04,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,security is very tight due \Nto the upcoming summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.70,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,Traffic will be restricted,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.97,italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,and the press will have limited access.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:13.95,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,We made it to the clock place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:19.11,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Where is Papa supposed to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:25.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog! Lemme see that vision again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:30.49,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,When the explosion went off, \Nthe clock went "bwong"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:33.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The hand was pointing to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:35.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Which means we have until...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:40.71,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I can't read the clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:45.29,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The long hand and the short hand...\N Which is which?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:53.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,How many more minutes until \Nthat clock goes "bwong"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:55.52,main,Old man,0,0,0,,Oh, are you talking about the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:12:01.24,main,Old man,0,0,0,,It rings every hour, so we've got about \Nthirty minutes until the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Fank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:05.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Thirty minutes... We have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.78,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Uh... How many minutes is thirty minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:19.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Mister Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.61,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's the bad guys' boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:36.05,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.62,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,He found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:58.09,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Get back in the car right now, you dumb mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.17,main,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:06.33,main,Keith,0,0,0,,If we don't get the hell outta here, \Nwe're gonna get caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:13.95,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you... You'd better work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:16.36,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,my impromptu trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:21.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,{\i1}He{\i0} causes the explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:24.66,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Just try and come after me, \Nyou stupid pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.40,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,The moment you set foot \Nin our hideout... Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That building...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.28,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,The explosion may cause a few casualties...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.41,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,But they're necessary \Nsacrifices to our great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:42.42,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Then again, you'll be dying for our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.72,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll all feel honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:55.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We have to do \Nsomething about that bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:59.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Let's see... The hand on the \Nclock went from six to seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.66,main,Anya,0,0,0,,so there are seven minutes left?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:04.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um, uh... Just hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:17.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:27.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, right! If I open the door,\N it'll go kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I think I can get in that little window.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:37.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hup... Hup...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mister Dog, push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:49.51,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The bomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:56.19,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If I can disarm this, I can save Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:04.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But how do you disarm a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:10.41,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,On TV, when they do the thing where they \Npick the red wire or the blue wire, it stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:11.44,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:13.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:15.21,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Sh-Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:17.78,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The wires are all black!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.24,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,And I don't have scissors \Nto choppy the wires!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:24.39,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,What should I do? \NThere's probably no more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:28.22,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If Papa comes here, \NI'll tell him he can't come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:32.47,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,But then he'll find out lots of stuff, \Nand he might not want me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:36.99,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,But if Papa dies, both Anya and \Npeace will be in big danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.92,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,That must be point B1.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.67,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,It's the northernmost \Nroom on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:57.93,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Hurry it up. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:03.55,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,What is that? Something written in blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, that smell... Is it ketchup?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:09.81,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,A doorknob, an eggplant, and some grass?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:11.51,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Is it some new kind of code?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:14.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't sense anyone's presence, \Nbut let's proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:18.06,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,No, there's no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:20.45,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,The minister will head out at any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:23.07,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,We're not going to be outdone \Nby some college student!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:33.22,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa... Did you notice my message in blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:35.98,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,He's too far away for me to read his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:37.84,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:51.48,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That's the time I saw in \Nthe future... I think!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:53.89,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,An explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:57.90,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,didn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:01.01,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,We did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:18.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:22.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We saved the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:24.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:27.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This might be some kind of message.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Carelessness could cost us our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:38.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,As I figured... It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:40.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If we'd opened the door, \Na bomb would've gone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:44.46,main,Senior agent,0,0,0,,So this was a bomb, not an eggplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:45.78,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.31,0:17:49.54,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,Looks like they knew we'd come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.20,main,Senior agent,0,0,0,,But who drew this warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Looks like we don't have time to ponder that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:58.40,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The Secret Police have caught on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:01.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's leave the message up \Nand let them disarm the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:04.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We should get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:08.69,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,I guess we never found Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:12.44,main,Junior Agent,0,0,0,,Investigating any further with the Secret\N Police snooping around will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's head to the minister's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:17.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Considering this plan has been ruined,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:20.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,our suspect may try some desperate measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:26.21,main,Secretary,0,0,0,,Minister Brantz, it is time. \NLet us head to the guest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:28.67,main,Secretary,0,0,0,,The members of their Department \Nof Foreign Affairs are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:34.40,main,Brantz,0,0,0,,Hmph. Apparently the government has \Neyes everywhere in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:38.45,main,Secretary,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is also because \Nof the terrorist incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:42.14,main,Brantz,0,0,0,,WISE still hasn't eliminated the suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.55,main,Brantz,0,0,0,,What a worthless lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:50.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I'm from intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.85,0:18:59.91,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Minister, if you're ready, \Nour car will take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:03.90,main,Fake Brantz,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.57,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Right this way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:11.66,main,Fake Brantz,0,0,0,,No, I think I'll take a car alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:13.66,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.75,main,Fake Brantz,0,0,0,,You may all go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:17.18,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Sir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:28.51,italics,Fake Brantz,0,0,0,,I should be far enough out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:31.79,italics,Fake Brantz,0,0,0,,As I figured, he's following me \Nby using the dog to track my scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:34.69,main,Brantz,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this, Sylvia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:37.37,main,Brantz,0,0,0,,I opened the door because I thought \None of your men showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:39.19,main,Brantz,0,0,0,,and the thief took my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:41.46,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll be borrowing your clothes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.20,flashback,Brantz,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:46.16,italics,Brantz,0,0,0,,Do your men have no manners?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:50.21,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I do apologize, Minister, \Nbut this was rather urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:54.08,main,Slyvia,0,0,0,,I presume he needed your scent \Nto throw the dog off your trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:58.09,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The enemy should now be several \Nkilometers away, pursuing a fake minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:00.33,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Please leave now, while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:03.18,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Oh, and to preserve our nation's dignity,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:05.31,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,please do put on some clothes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:08.37,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Minister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:12.86,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,He changed his route?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:18.36,main,Keith,0,0,0,,He changed it {\i1}again{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:24.87,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell? Why does \Nhe keep going in circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:34.01,main,Senior agent,0,0,0,,We have eyes on him. He's in a gray coupe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.92,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,As far as I can see, he only has one dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:40.07,italics,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,We'll surround him. Lead him to Blue 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:43.30,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,What? He's heading back to the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:45.52,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,No, he's heading toward the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.05,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,A place with few people around...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.84,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.07,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:05.69,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! Fall back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:14.37,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,He got us... He still had some explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:17.17,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Be careful. He's heading in your direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:25.92,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:32.40,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.38,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,He kindly got out of the car for me. That fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:38.17,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:44.77,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll set off the bomb right \Nwhen the dog bites onto him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:55.79,italics,Keith,0,0,0,,Don't you dare think you can \Nget away from a trained dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:09.35,main,Keith,0,0,0,,What the hell?! The Minister \Nof the West is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:11.17,main,Keith,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be a 60-year-old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:13.68,main,Keith,0,0,0,,Shit! I'll lose sight of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:23.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure the last thing you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,was to get dragged into some foolish \Nconflict between humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:29.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(475,285)\fscx49}A NEW FAMILY MEMBER
